<h2>Asobi 0.8 (build 608)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>See who is driving a live review.</b> While you are in a room, a chip at the top center of the picture reads <b>LIVE &#183; you</b> or <b>LIVE &#183; Ekta</b>, naming whoever last moved the playhead. Web viewers see the same name in their LIVE chip.</li>
<li><b>Passphrase-protected links open in the app.</b> Paste a review link that was shared with &#8220;Require a spoken passphrase&#8221; on and Asobi asks for the four words, just as the browser does. A wrong answer asks again.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
